From 44d61e8353d381dc1f35f6995ae3bde309951f1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:37:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Packaging: SlideCraft installer identity (held, untested on
 real machines)

Prepared for decision 007; not merged. Moves the installers and APP_ID
from ai.storyteller.deckcraft to io.github.offset54.slidecraft, renames
the product in installers, replaces ArtCraft links and the ArtCraft
Windows suite folder, gives the MSI a new UpgradeCode, and associates
.slidecraft on every desktop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XQuQYmuV1H2C5vAozrJGri
